{
  "rule": "v1 projection of sidecar-carrying html nodes (sanitize-ast.ts, wire-contract design §5 step 1b / §10): data.crowiMath → math/inlineMath, data.crowiDiagram → crowiDiagram, data.crowiLinkCard → crowiLinkCard (hoisted to block position, splitting its paragraph), data.crowiPlaceholder → crowiPlaceholder. A schema-invalid sidecar leaves the html node as-is; a schema-valid sidecar whose payload fails deep validation (e.g. bad base64) becomes crowiPlaceholder{kind:\"validation-failed\"}; a sidecar-less html node stays html (declared clients render it as a visible opaque placeholder); an unknown node type becomes crowiOpaque{reason:\"unknown-type\"}.",
  "why": "These are the typed-node schema shapes iOS decodes with a strict discriminated-union decoder — the projection outputs pinned here are the exact wire forms. The stored inputs are synthetic because dispatch does not run in this corpus (see exclusions): the html node VALUES are stand-ins the projection never reads; only the sidecar payloads matter. crowiCode is deliberately absent here — its projection is pinned from real shiki output in code.json.",
  "consumers": [
    "packages/api/src/renderer/golden-corpus.test.ts",
    "apps/apple/CrowiKit/Tests/CrowiKitTests/RenderedAstGoldenCorpusTests.swift"
  ],
  "consumerContract": "The api jest driver asserts the PRODUCER side (markdown → expectedAst via runPipeline with an empty registry, and storedAst/expectedAst → expectedEnvelope via sanitizeAst). The CrowiKit XCTest asserts the CONSUMER side (its sanitize-walker mirror over storedAst/expectedAst, and its strict envelope decoder over expectedEnvelope). The Swift consumer is wired up in Phase 4 (apps/apple lives on the feature-ios-app/impl branch).",
  "normalization": "none — expected values are exact.",
  "exclusions": "Plugin-dispatch output byte strings (Mermaid / PlantUML / link-card / shiki generated HTML) are deliberately NOT pinned by this corpus — packages/e2e/tests/renderer-plugins.spec.ts owns that coverage against a live server. The corpus pins parser/core-transform STRUCTURE and the v1 projection schema shapes only; where a stored html node value would be a generated byte string, the case either omits expectedAst (code.json) or uses a synthetic stand-in value the projection never reads (typed-nodes.json).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "math-display-projection",
      "why": "crowiMath{display:true} in flow position projects to a math node carrying the TeX source (the KaTeX html byte string is dropped from the wire)",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<span class=\"katex-display\">…generated KaTeX HTML…</span>",
            "data": {
              "crowiMath": {
                "tex": "E = mc^2",
                "display": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "E = mc^2"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "math-inline-projection",
      "why": "crowiMath{display:false} in phrasing position projects to inlineMath — display picks the node type AND constrains the position",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "mass-energy: "
              },
              {
                "type": "html",
                "value": "<span class=\"katex\">…generated KaTeX HTML…</span>",
                "data": {
                  "crowiMath": {
                    "tex": "E = mc^2",
                    "display": false
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "mass-energy: "
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "value": "E = mc^2"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "diagram-mermaid-svg-projection",
      "why": "crowiDiagram (SVG): kind/diagramType/alt and the image payload with REQUIRED intrinsic dimensions — the base64 is a re-validated (allowSafeHref:false) SVG",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<img alt=\"Mermaid diagram\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,…generated…\">",
            "data": {
              "crowiDiagram": {
                "kind": "mermaid",
                "diagramType": "flowchart",
                "alt": "Mermaid diagram",
                "image": {
                  "mediaType": "image/svg+xml",
                  "base64": "PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyMCAxMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjIwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwIj48L3JlY3Q+PC9zdmc+",
                  "width": 20,
                  "height": 10
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiDiagram",
              "kind": "mermaid",
              "diagramType": "flowchart",
              "alt": "Mermaid diagram",
              "image": {
                "mediaType": "image/svg+xml",
                "base64": "PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyMCAxMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjIwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwIi8+PC9zdmc+",
                "width": 20,
                "height": 10
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "diagram-plantuml-png-projection",
      "why": "crowiDiagram (PNG): the payload must actually BE a PNG (signature-checked); diagramType is optional",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<img alt=\"PlantUML diagram\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,…generated…\">",
            "data": {
              "crowiDiagram": {
                "kind": "plantuml",
                "alt": "PlantUML diagram",
                "image": {
                  "mediaType": "image/png",
                  "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAKCAYAAAA=",
                  "width": 20,
                  "height": 10
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiDiagram",
              "kind": "plantuml",
              "alt": "PlantUML diagram",
              "image": {
                "mediaType": "image/png",
                "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAKCAYAAAA=",
                "width": 20,
                "height": 10
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "link-card-hoist",
      "why": "crowiLinkCard is block in v1: a card inside a paragraph hoists out, splitting the paragraph into [paragraph(before), crowiLinkCard, paragraph(after)] — empty halves are never emitted",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "before "
              },
              {
                "type": "html",
                "value": "<a class=\"crowi-link-card\" href=\"https://example.com/article\">…generated card HTML…</a>",
                "data": {
                  "crowiLinkCard": {
                    "url": "https://example.com/article",
                    "title": "Example article",
                    "description": "An example page.",
                    "image": {
                      "url": "https://example.com/og.png"
                    },
                    "siteName": "Example",
                    "domain": "example.com"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " after"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "before "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "crowiLinkCard",
              "url": "https://example.com/article",
              "title": "Example article",
              "description": "An example page.",
              "image": {
                "url": "https://example.com/og.png"
              },
              "siteName": "Example",
              "domain": "example.com"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": " after"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "link-card-url-only",
      "why": "fetch failure and toggle-off both produce a url-only card — the two states are the SAME type and deliberately indistinguishable (parity with the byte-identical fallback html)",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "html",
                "value": "<a class=\"crowi-link-card crowi-link-card-fallback\" href=\"https://example.com/x\">…generated fallback card HTML…</a>",
                "data": {
                  "crowiLinkCard": {
                    "url": "https://example.com/x"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiLinkCard",
              "url": "https://example.com/x"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "placeholder-projection",
      "why": "crowiPlaceholder: kind (closed enum) + label + reservation — the reservation dimensions let clients reserve layout before deciding how to render the failure",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<div class=\"crowi-render-placeholder\">…generated placeholder HTML…</div>",
            "data": {
              "crowiPlaceholder": {
                "kind": "error-timeout",
                "label": "Rendering timed out",
                "reservation": {
                  "variant": "fixed",
                  "heightPx": 120
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiPlaceholder",
              "kind": "error-timeout",
              "label": "Rendering timed out",
              "reservation": {
                "variant": "fixed",
                "heightPx": 120
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "invalid-sidecar-stays-html",
      "why": "a sidecar that fails its schema (crowiDiagram without image) does NOT project: the html node stays (and the sidecar key is dropped from v1 data) — declared clients show the opaque-html placeholder",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<img alt=\"broken\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,…generated…\">",
            "data": {
              "crowiDiagram": {
                "kind": "mermaid",
                "alt": "broken"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "html",
              "value": "<img alt=\"broken\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,…generated…\">"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "diagram-bad-base64-validation-failed",
      "why": "a schema-valid sidecar whose base64 fails strict decoding degrades to crowiPlaceholder{kind:\"validation-failed\"} — deep payload validation is the v1 trust boundary, not producer goodwill",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<img alt=\"broken\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,…generated…\">",
            "data": {
              "crowiDiagram": {
                "kind": "mermaid",
                "alt": "broken",
                "image": {
                  "mediaType": "image/svg+xml",
                  "base64": "!!not-base64!!",
                  "width": 20,
                  "height": 10
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiPlaceholder",
              "kind": "validation-failed",
              "label": "This content could not be displayed.",
              "reservation": {
                "variant": "fixed",
                "heightPx": 48
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sidecar-less-html-stays",
      "why": "author/plugin html without a sidecar is indistinguishable and stays an html node — non-web declared clients MUST render it as a visible placeholder (never execute, never silently drop)",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<div class=\"custom\">author html</div>"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "html",
              "value": "<div class=\"custom\">author html</div>"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "unknown-type-opaque",
      "why": "an unregistered node type (third-party plugin output) becomes crowiOpaque{reason:\"unknown-type\", originalType truncated to 64 chars}; its children are NOT recursed — one unknown node never fails the envelope",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "x-sample-plugin-callout",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "plugin content"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiOpaque",
              "reason": "unknown-type",
              "originalType": "x-sample-plugin-callout"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
